  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the minified wire format used by compute_merged_rules_value. Long names match the HsfRuleWithRecipe / RuleRaw fields; short names are compact aliases sent across the WASM boundary to reduce payload size on large workloads (45k+ rules). Both TS (minify/expand helpers) and Rust (#[serde(rename)] attrs on RuleRawWire / RuleSubRawWire / ComputeMergedRulesInWire) must match this mapping. An integration test verifies consistency.",

